# Representative transitional News coverage using the current shared discussion bridge.
# It deliberately leaves legacy News categories, announcements, promotion, and moderation
# unmodelled; those are not part of the active shared publication/read/reply lifecycle.

-- scenario.meta --
Format: goa4web-scenario/v1
Name: news
Description: Published News item with a reader-visible shared discussion reply

-- 010-writer.event --
Op: user.create
Ref: writer
Username: news-writer
Email: news-writer@example.test
Password: writer-test
At: 2026-08-03T08:00:00Z

-- 011-enable-writer.event --
Op: user.enable
Actor: admin
User: writer
At: 2026-08-03T08:01:00Z

-- 012-writer-post.event --
Op: user.grant
User: writer
Section: news
Item: post
Action: post
At: 2026-08-03T08:02:00Z

-- 013-writer-see.event --
Op: user.grant
User: writer
Section: news
Item: post
Action: see
At: 2026-08-03T08:03:00Z

-- 014-writer-view.event --
Op: user.grant
User: writer
Section: news
Item: post
Action: view
At: 2026-08-03T08:04:00Z

-- 020-reader.event --
Op: user.create
Ref: reader
Username: news-reader
Email: news-reader@example.test
Password: reader-test
At: 2026-08-03T08:10:00Z

-- 021-enable-reader.event --
Op: user.enable
Actor: admin
User: reader
At: 2026-08-03T08:11:00Z

-- 022-reader-see.event --
Op: user.grant
User: reader
Section: news
Item: post
Action: see
At: 2026-08-03T08:12:00Z

-- 023-reader-view.event --
Op: user.grant
User: reader
Section: news
Item: post
Action: view
At: 2026-08-03T08:13:00Z

-- 024-reader-reply.event --
Op: user.grant
User: reader
Section: news
Item: post
Action: reply
At: 2026-08-03T08:14:00Z

-- 100-launch.event --
Op: news.post.create
Ref: launch
Actor: writer
Language: 1
At: 2026-08-03T09:00:00Z

Goa4Web 2.0 is now available.

-- 110-reader-reply.event --
Op: news.reply
Ref: reader-launch-reply
Actor: reader
News: launch
Language: 1
At: 2026-08-03T10:00:00Z

Congratulations to everyone involved!
